/E (That progress outweighed a sharp increase in retail, where a heavy wave of regional-mall loans transferred into special servicing for maturity default, lifting the retail rate 33 basis points to 13.28%. Multifamily rose 16 basis points to 8.39%, and mixed-use edged up two basis points to 11.93%. )
